      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/anachronismaxe/{size}/2163_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-05-03T17:36:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;imprimis5&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"imprimis5\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I’m excited for bios. We’ve had so much dribbled to us piecemeal that it’s hard to keep track. It is, admittedly, pretty exciting, though. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah, considering that the website bios are more in-depth than the ones that come with the core game and expansions, I’m really looking forward to more elaboration on Rook City and Infernal Relics characters (not to mention Unity and Ambuscade!)</p>",
